{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"0188e8e5339144a0bf029fd18acfba0e","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"bdce938da89f4a45e1ab627ae8de53a3fbe0","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=bdce938da89f4a45e1ab627ae8de53a3fbe0","view_num":2255,"pub_timestamp":"1706774100","title":"2월 5일 업데이트 공지","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=bdce938da89f4a45e1ab627ae8de53a3fbe0","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"5c43b981560d95e41a7d5c64842396fd\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e존경하는\u0026nbsp;지휘관님,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e오래\u0026nbsp;기다려\u0026nbsp;주셔서\u0026nbsp;진심으로\u0026nbsp;감사드립니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검이\u0026nbsp;완료되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;보상은\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;메일함에서\u0026nbsp;확인해\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이번\u0026nbsp;업데이트는\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;클라이언트가\u0026nbsp;업데이트되어\u0026nbsp;스토어에서\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;버전\u0026nbsp;클라이언트를\u0026nbsp;새로\u0026nbsp;다운로드하셔야만\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;다운로드를\u0026nbsp;위해,\u0026nbsp;디바이스의\u0026nbsp;저장\u0026nbsp;공간은\u0026nbsp;최소\u0026nbsp;5GB\u0026nbsp;이상\u0026nbsp;확보해\u0026nbsp;주시기를\u0026nbsp;권장드립니다.\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전의\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;Launcher에서\u0026nbsp;[게임\u0026nbsp;시작]\u0026nbsp;버튼을\u0026nbsp;터치하면\u0026nbsp;최신\u0026nbsp;클라이언트로\u0026nbsp;업데이트가\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[리소스\u0026nbsp;파일\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;과정에서\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하는\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;클라이언트\u0026nbsp;리소스\u0026nbsp;다운로드에\u0026nbsp;실패할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있사오니,\u0026nbsp;다운로드\u0026nbsp;중엔\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;앱을\u0026nbsp;강제\u0026nbsp;종료하지\u0026nbsp;말아\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e홍련\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;흑영은\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼),\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e레오나는\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼)에선\u0026nbsp;모집할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e업데이트\u0026nbsp;주요\u0026nbsp;내용:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.1\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[프리바티\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;언카인드\u0026nbsp;메이드]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e큰\u0026nbsp;실수를\u0026nbsp;저질러\u0026nbsp;부끄러움\u0026nbsp;많은\u0026nbsp;메이드가\u0026nbsp;된\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[프리바티\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;언카인드\u0026nbsp;메이드]가\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집에\u0026nbsp;합류합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e샷건을\u0026nbsp;사용하며,\u0026nbsp;공격할수록\u0026nbsp;명중률이\u0026nbsp;증가하는\u0026nbsp;니케.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e명중한\u0026nbsp;펠릿의\u0026nbsp;숫자에\u0026nbsp;따라서\u0026nbsp;스킬을\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;자주\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;클래스:\u0026nbsp;화력형\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;무기:\u0026nbsp;낫\u0026nbsp;러블리\u0026nbsp;건(SG)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;코드:\u0026nbsp;전격\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;기업:\u0026nbsp;엘리시온\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*획득처:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;대원\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*모집\u0026nbsp;안내:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①쥬얼(무료/유료)\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;고급\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓으로\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집을\u0026nbsp;진행할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;(일반\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e②특수\u0026nbsp;모집의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;SSR니케\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;4%이며,\u0026nbsp;그중\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;[프리바티\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;언카인드\u0026nbsp;메이드]의\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;2%입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e③특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e④200개의\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;모아\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서[프리바티\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;언카인드\u0026nbsp;메이드]를\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑤특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;사용하지\u0026nbsp;않은\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;소멸되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑥특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;[프리바티\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;언카인드\u0026nbsp;메이드]는\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼)에선\u0026nbsp;모집할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.2\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[에이드]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e메이드\u0026nbsp;포\u0026nbsp;유\u0026nbsp;스쿼드의\u0026nbsp;완벽한\u0026nbsp;메이드,\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;[에이드]가\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집에\u0026nbsp;합류합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e아군이\u0026nbsp;해로운\u0026nbsp;효과에\u0026nbsp;걸리지\u0026nbsp;않도록\u0026nbsp;방어해\u0026nbsp;주는\u0026nbsp;능력을\u0026nbsp;가진\u0026nbsp;니케.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e아군\u0026nbsp;전체의\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;체력과\u0026nbsp;공격력도\u0026nbsp;증가시켜,\u0026nbsp;방어적인\u0026nbsp;면과\u0026nbsp;공격적인\u0026nbsp;면을\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;지원합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;클래스:\u0026nbsp;지원형\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;무기:\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;클래식\u0026nbsp;(AR)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;코드:\u0026nbsp;풍압\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e-\u0026nbsp;기업:\u0026nbsp;테트라\u0026nbsp;라인\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;15일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;29일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*획득처:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;대원\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*모집\u0026nbsp;안내:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①쥬얼(무료/유료)\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;고급\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓으로\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집을\u0026nbsp;진행할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;(일반\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e②특수\u0026nbsp;모집의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;4%이며,\u0026nbsp;그중\u0026nbsp;SSR\u0026nbsp;[에이드]의\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;확률은\u0026nbsp;2%입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e③특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e④200개의\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓을\u0026nbsp;모아\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점에서[에이드]를\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑤특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;사용하지\u0026nbsp;않은\u0026nbsp;골드\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;티켓은\u0026nbsp;소멸되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e⑥특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;업데이트\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;[에이드]는\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;소셜\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;몰드\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;(신규\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;모집,\u0026nbsp;일반\u0026nbsp;모집(튜토리얼)에선\u0026nbsp;모집할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;없습니다.)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.3\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;기능\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;사격장에서\u0026nbsp;현재\u0026nbsp;픽업\u0026nbsp;중인\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;특수\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;스쿼드에\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류하여\u0026nbsp;체험하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;가능\u0026nbsp;기간:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①[프리바티\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;언카인드\u0026nbsp;메이드]:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e②[에이드]:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;15일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;29일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이외,\u0026nbsp;복귀\u0026nbsp;지휘관님께서는\u0026nbsp;복귀\u0026nbsp;이벤트의\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;기능을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;체험하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.1\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;코스튬:\u0026nbsp;드레이크-메이드\u0026nbsp;포\u0026nbsp;빌런\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e메이드\u0026nbsp;카페를\u0026nbsp;휩쓴\u0026nbsp;친절한\u0026nbsp;빌런.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[드레이크-메이드\u0026nbsp;포\u0026nbsp;빌런]은\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eVILLAIN\u0026nbsp;PASS\u0026nbsp;FOR\u0026nbsp;U\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e에서\u0026nbsp;획득할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eVILLAIN\u0026nbsp;PASS\u0026nbsp;FOR\u0026nbsp;U\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e에\u0026nbsp;대한\u0026nbsp;안내는\u0026nbsp;아래\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;안내에서\u0026nbsp;확인하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.1\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;PERFECT\u0026nbsp;MAID\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e밸런타인데이를\u0026nbsp;앞두고\u0026nbsp;메이드\u0026nbsp;포\u0026nbsp;유의\u0026nbsp;완벽한\u0026nbsp;메이드,\u0026nbsp;에이드는\u0026nbsp;그\u0026nbsp;완벽한\u0026nbsp;모습\u0026nbsp;때문에\u0026nbsp;손님들에게\u0026nbsp;감동을\u0026nbsp;주지\u0026nbsp;못한다는\u0026nbsp;것에\u0026nbsp;충격에\u0026nbsp;빠진다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e그러던\u0026nbsp;중,\u0026nbsp;프리바티와\u0026nbsp;드레이크가\u0026nbsp;테러\u0026nbsp;진압\u0026nbsp;과정에서\u0026nbsp;실수로\u0026nbsp;메이드\u0026nbsp;포\u0026nbsp;유의\u0026nbsp;메이드\u0026nbsp;카페에\u0026nbsp;유탄을\u0026nbsp;날리게\u0026nbsp;되는데....\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003ePERFECT\u0026nbsp;MAID\u0026nbsp;이벤트에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u0026nbsp;클리어\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;아이템을\u0026nbsp;획득하고\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;다양한\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;상점의\u0026nbsp;아이템\u0026nbsp;교환은\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;종료됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e①챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[챌린지\u0026nbsp;스테이지]가\u0026nbsp;PERFECT\u0026nbsp;MAID에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;고난이도의\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;스테이지에\u0026nbsp;도전하여\u0026nbsp;각종\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득해\u0026nbsp;보세요!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.2\u0026nbsp;미니게임:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eDessert\u0026nbsp;Rush\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e몰려드는\u0026nbsp;디저트\u0026nbsp;주문에\u0026nbsp;소다는\u0026nbsp;혼란에\u0026nbsp;빠져,\u0026nbsp;선반\u0026nbsp;위의\u0026nbsp;물건들을\u0026nbsp;디저트\u0026nbsp;위에\u0026nbsp;쏟아버리고\u0026nbsp;만다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e폭탄이\u0026nbsp;든\u0026nbsp;디저트와\u0026nbsp;맛있는\u0026nbsp;디저트를\u0026nbsp;구분하여,\u0026nbsp;혼란의\u0026nbsp;메이드\u0026nbsp;카페를\u0026nbsp;구해내야\u0026nbsp;한다!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.3\u0026nbsp;7\u0026nbsp;Days\u0026nbsp;Login\u0026nbsp;이벤트-UNKIND\u0026nbsp;MAID\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;매일\u0026nbsp;게임에\u0026nbsp;접속하여\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;7일까지\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득\u0026nbsp;하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;로그인\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료가\u0026nbsp;포함된\u0026nbsp;모든\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.4\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;MAID\u0026nbsp;IN\u0026nbsp;VALENTINE\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;MAID\u0026nbsp;IN\u0026nbsp;VALENTINE이\u0026nbsp;아카이브에\u0026nbsp;추가됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;PERFECT\u0026nbsp;MAID에\u0026nbsp;참여하여\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트를\u0026nbsp;해금할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;[메모리\u0026nbsp;필름]을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;전초기지\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;커맨드\u0026nbsp;센터\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;회상\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.5\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;초기화\u0026nbsp;기능\u0026nbsp;오픈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*스킬\u0026nbsp;초기화\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;12일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e12:00:00\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*스킬\u0026nbsp;초기화\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;[니케\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;정보\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;스킬]\u0026nbsp;진입,\u0026nbsp;[스킬\u0026nbsp;언인스톨러]를\u0026nbsp;사용해\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;1개의\u0026nbsp;스킬을\u0026nbsp;초기화할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;메일함을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;[스킬\u0026nbsp;언인스톨러]\u0026nbsp;3개가\u0026nbsp;지급됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.6\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e주말\u0026nbsp;FULL\u0026nbsp;BURST\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;10일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;12일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;17일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;19일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e주말\u0026nbsp;FULL\u0026nbsp;BURST\u0026nbsp;DAY\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;요격전\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸에서의\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;한\u0026nbsp;번\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.7\u0026nbsp;Daily\u0026nbsp;Bonus\u0026nbsp;Reward\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;10일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;12일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;17일\u0026nbsp;5:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;19일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안,\u0026nbsp;일일\u0026nbsp;미션을\u0026nbsp;모두\u0026nbsp;완료하면\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e스킬\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e예상치\u0026nbsp;못한\u0026nbsp;추가\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e솔로\u0026nbsp;레이드가\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;9일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00(UTC+9)에\u0026nbsp;오픈됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e솔로\u0026nbsp;단위로\u0026nbsp;여러개의\u0026nbsp;파티를\u0026nbsp;사용하여\u0026nbsp;보스를\u0026nbsp;도전하고\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;큐브\u0026nbsp;재료를\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;도전\u0026nbsp;난이도에선\u0026nbsp;가장\u0026nbsp;높은\u0026nbsp;누적\u0026nbsp;피해량을\u0026nbsp;보유한\u0026nbsp;기준으로\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;순위를\u0026nbsp;정하고,\u0026nbsp;랭킹에\u0026nbsp;따라\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;프레임,\u0026nbsp;쥬얼을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*오픈\u0026nbsp;시간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;9일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;16일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e지휘관\u0026nbsp;5명이\u0026nbsp;협동하여\u0026nbsp;보스\u0026nbsp;[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e모더니아\u0026nbsp;[D.M.T.R.]]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e에\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;도전합니다.\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전은\u0026nbsp;친구나\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;멤버\u0026nbsp;혹은\u0026nbsp;자동\u0026nbsp;매칭을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;도전이\u0026nbsp;가능합니다.\u0026nbsp;보스를\u0026nbsp;처치하여\u0026nbsp;획득한\u0026nbsp;부서진\u0026nbsp;코어는\u0026nbsp;고철\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;쥬얼,\u0026nbsp;육성\u0026nbsp;재료\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;보상으로\u0026nbsp;교환하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;16일\u0026nbsp;12:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;18일\u0026nbsp;23:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*\u0026nbsp;참여\u0026nbsp;방법:\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;협동\u0026nbsp;작전\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;기능\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e아카이브의\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;하드\u0026nbsp;모드에\u0026nbsp;빠른\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가\u0026nbsp;되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;상품\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.1\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;신규\u0026nbsp;캐릭터\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;패키지가\u0026nbsp;갱신됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*판매\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;～2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;29일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e상세한\u0026nbsp;정보는\u0026nbsp;[로비\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;캐시\u0026nbsp;상점\u0026nbsp;→\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;패키지]에서\u0026nbsp;확인하여\u0026nbsp;주시기\u0026nbsp;바랍니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.2\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eVILLAIN\u0026nbsp;PASS\u0026nbsp;FOR\u0026nbsp;U\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e*이벤트\u0026nbsp;기간:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;5일\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e서버\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;종료\u0026nbsp;이후\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;2024년\u0026nbsp;2월\u0026nbsp;22일\u0026nbsp;4:59:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;(UTC+9)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eVILLAIN\u0026nbsp;PASS\u0026nbsp;FOR\u0026nbsp;U\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e의\u0026nbsp;프리미엄\u0026nbsp;패스\u0026nbsp;구매\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;일일\u0026nbsp;미션을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;Pass\u0026nbsp;레벨\u0026nbsp;업\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;고급\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;티켓\u0026nbsp;등\u0026nbsp;보상을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;레벨을\u0026nbsp;달성하면\u0026nbsp;드레이크의\u0026nbsp;한정\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;[메이드\u0026nbsp;포\u0026nbsp;빌런]을\u0026nbsp;획득하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e개선\u0026nbsp;사항\u0026nbsp;\u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;기타\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.1\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e알려진\u0026nbsp;이슈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e①\u0026nbsp;솔로레이드\u0026nbsp;도전\u0026nbsp;모드에서\u0026nbsp;셀렉트\u0026nbsp;링\u0026nbsp;패턴\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;패턴\u0026nbsp;카운트다운\u00